Lacy is a reporter for the Deadman's Vale Chronicle, a newpaper sold in the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Hidden Gulch]]. She's proficient in stealth and song, and currently has a deal with [[Org/Althane/The Weft|The Weft]] to write their exposé once they've finished their business in the gulch.

Lacy is a young adult [[Bestiary/Spark of Humanity#Kithkin|Kithkin]] with auburn hair and gray eyes. She carries around a notepad and quill, as well as a lute in case she gets into a pinch.
